# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# graph_bot — what never leaves this machine
#
# Three rules behind everything below:
#   1. SECRETS never get committed, and are listed first so they are obvious.
#   2. MEDIA never gets committed — output/ and export/ alone are ~860 MB, and
#      caches another ~430 MB. The pipeline regenerates all of it.
#   3. RUNTIME STATE never gets committed. Uploads, jobs and analytics live in
#      Postgres; the JSON files under data/ are a pre-migration backup of the
#      channel's own operating record, not source.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config/client_secret.json
config/youtube_token.json
config/*token*.json
config/*secret*.json
config/*credential*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ── python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── node (the dashboard UI is built, not shipped as source deps) ─────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.vite/

# ── generated video + media ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
output/
export/
upload/
logs/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a

# ── caches and generated assets ──────────────────────────────────────────────
data/cache/
data/music_cache/
data/manim_media/
data/flags/
media/           # Manim's own scratch directory

# Music is licensed per-track and stays local; keep the folder's README.
assets/music/*
!assets/music/README.md

# ── runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The operational store is Postgres (graph_bot.store). These files are the
# pre-migration backup of a real channel's upload history — not source, and not
# something to publish.
data/upload_log.json
data/discarded.json
data/queue_order.json
data/dashboard_jobs.json
data/brand.json
data/export/

# Channel analytics exports: private business data.
analytics_data/
!analytics_data/README.md

# Brand identity — banner, avatar, watermark, community art. The repo is public
# and these are the channel's visual identity, not part of the software.
assets/brand/

# Unpublished series roadmaps. These are editorial plans for episodes that have
# not shipped; the published series' docs stay.
docs/SERIES_how_charts_lie.md
docs/SERIES_llm_basics.md

# A generated report, derived from the store.
UPLOAD_QUEUE.md

# ── os / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
